  "body": "Set in a tightly held cul-de-sac, this exceptional 1308sqm (approx.) property presents a rare chance to secure space, versatility, and future potential in one of Red Beach's most desirable locations.  \r\n\r\nThe three-bedroom home is complemented by a generous extended two-bedroom sleep out perfect for multi-generational living, guests, or additional income. Light-filled and welcoming, the home offers spacious living zones and a modernised kitchen, all flowing effortlessly to a sun-soaked deck ideal for entertaining. \r\n\r\nCar enthusiasts and those needing extra storage will appreciate the impressive garaging with further potential and plenty of off-street parking, with the flexibility to convert the garage and sleepout back to further garaging if desired. The fully fenced grounds provide peace of mind for families and pets alike. With significant landholding comes outstanding potential-whether you're considering future development, land banking, or simply enjoying the space as is. In the meantime, this is a wonderful home to live in, grow a family, and embrace the lifestyle on offer.  \r\n\r\nConveniently located with easy access to the Orewa Estuary and beach, quality local schools, motorway links, and Silverdale's thriving shopping hub, this is a property that truly ticks all the boxes.",
